  "content": "<h4>“基金会”被C.I.和众多裂隙摧毁。这个世界充斥着奇怪而危险的生物与物件。你接到了一通电话，要求你建造一个遗址来收容SCP。在这个生存模式下，你需要建造一个收容设施来关押尽可能多的SCP，同时你也必须生存下来、武装自己并消灭最危险的生物。FR</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4>The \"foundation\" was destroyed by the C.I. and by numerous breaches. This world is overrun with strange and dangerous creatures and objects. You got a call asking you to build a site to contain the SCPs. In this survival, you will have to build a containment to lock up as many SCPs as possible but also you will have to survive, arm and neutralize the most dangerous creatures. ENG</h4>\n<p>(If you want to have cities you have to select cities in the world config and put them in rare-cities mode in the future version that will be done automatically)&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">V3.0-?</span>&nbsp;: <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#169179\">在發生所有SCP的普遍泄漏後</span>, <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">SCP-008已逃脫並感染所有城市</span>, <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">政府試圖阻止新的毀滅</span></span>但<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#34495e\">所做的努力是徒勞且致命的</span>. <span style=\"color:#ba372a\">普通敵對生物消失，只留下SCP和殭屍</span></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">如果你想要我建立一個新的等級列表來列出模組包中存在的所有SCP<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftiermaker.com%252fcreate%252fscp-reimagined-16925960\" rel=\"nofollow\">建立SCP重想像等級列表 - TierMaker</a></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">一些圖片</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1064005/description_f48df35c-f8f6-45ff-b5e6-4d73f030872a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"440\" height=\"440\"></p>\n<h3>SCP-2863</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:right\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1064005/description_a4ac3951-9411-4977-8218-8ff7119a914d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"439\" height=\"439\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:right\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:right\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:right\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:right\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:right\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:right\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:right\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:right\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:right\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:right\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:right\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:right\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:right\">SCP-745</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Wabbanode Hosting</span></strong>正式<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">與我們<strong>合作!!!</strong></span></h3>\n<h3>這裡有<strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">連結</span></strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"> </span>讓你可以享有<strong style=\"color:#2dc26b\">與朋友一起冒險</strong>或你的<strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">未來敵人&nbsp;</strong></strong></h3>\n<p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252fgames%252fminecraft-server-hosting%252f1064005%252fscp-reimagined\" rel=\"nofollow\">SCP Reimagined 伺服器託管 | Wabbanode</a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1064005/description_24535359-14eb-4045-8a7e-e4e0b17855be.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"133\"></p>",
